{"id":135441366,"slug":"stop-physician-burnout-with-handwaving","title":"Stop Physician Burnout With Handwaving Mechanical Turks! ","subtitle":"The horror of predicting the future of stupid.","post_date":"2023-07-25T15:14:00.727Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/stop-physician-burnout-with-handwaving","wordcount":186,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:58:05.544Z","body_sha256":"74d0813b9dcbb6d65167d5dbf6df5d729e1137a1eaa943dd5cdce2ad4819e025","text_words":189,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>Generative AI is here.  It is going to disrupt things…</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tTru!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5cf402e5-c5e4-4bdc-8e1c-918326354013_1290x1432.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tTru!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5cf402e5-c5e4-4bdc-8e1c-918326354013_1290x1432.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tTru!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5cf402e5-c5e4-4bdc-8e1c-918326354013_1290x1432.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tTru!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_au